OL,3,GNEWSAFans pay their respects at Sir
OL,4,ABilly Boston's funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FFriends, family and players past and
OL,7,Fpresent have gathered to pay their
OL,8,Frespects at the funeral of Wigan rugby
OL,9,Fleague legend Sir Billy Boston.
OL,11,FBoston, the first player in rugby
OL,12,Fleague's 130-year history to receive a
OL,13,Fknighthood, died last month aged 92.
OL,15,FHis funeral took place at Wigan
OL,16,FWarriors' Brick Community Stadium, with
OL,17,Fmourners including many of the club's
OL,18,Fcurrent squad.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
